<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PepsiCo EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PepsiCo EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Jennifer Salomon cut her 1996 Eearnings per share forecast for PepsiCo Inc to $1.25 from $1.38 and her 1997 EPS view to $1.51 from $1.60.</p>
<p>-- She cited continuing weakness in the restaurant and international soft drink business.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/2 at 28-5/8 in active trading.  </p>
<p>-- She said she reiterated her buy rating on the stock.</p>
</text>
